## What Are Ethical Hacking Services?

Ethical hacking is the process of testing computer systems, networks, websites, and applications to identify security weaknesses before malicious attackers can exploit them. Professional ethical hackers use authorized testing techniques to assess security controls and recommend practical improvements.

These services help organizations understand their cybersecurity risks and develop effective strategies to protect confidential business information.

